        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The team of experienced treasure hunters rushes again to meet adventures!\nDuring a regular inventory at the museum, archaeologist Claire comes across an unfamiliar book with a mysterious lock-puzzle adorned with precious stones.\nAfter unsuccessful attempts to open the book, the girl, in anger, presses a strange mechanism, and all the stones from it fall out immediately!\nThe museum room quickly changes into a forest with giant trees - the book has taken Claire and the team to its world.\nWill the brave treasure hunter be able to find the lost stones and return home?\nEmbark on a heroic mission with Claire - quench your thirst for adventure and help her find all the stones!\nConvenient controls and clear training will help you easily get into the basics of the game.\nEmbark on an exciting journey through the world of the Enigmatic Book!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2023",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
